Upstream-Name: r8169 (Linux kernel driver)
Upstream-Contact: netdev@vger.kernel.org
Source: https://github.com/MajorP93/ubuntu-kernel-mirror/tree/Ubuntu-7.0.0-41.41/drivers/net/ethernet/realtek
Comment: src/ is drivers/net/ethernet/realtek of the Ubuntu kernel (see
 upstream.conf for the exact tag and commit), plus the Proxmox VE kernel's
 r8169 patches and backported fixes from the Linux kernel. Only the r8169 files from src/ are installed by the binary
 package; the other drivers are part of the source package only.

